{"headword":"טוֹבָה","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.f. welfare, benefit, good things, good</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">ט׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 28:11\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.28.11\">Dt 28:11</a> + 54 times; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">טוֹבַת</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 106:5\" href=\"/Psalms.106.5\">ψ 106:5</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">טוֹבָתִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 16:2\" href=\"/Psalms.16.2\">ψ 16:2</a> etc. + 4 times sfs.; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">טוֹבוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 12:6\" href=\"/Jeremiah.12.6\">Je 12:6</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">טֹבוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 25:28\" href=\"/II_Kings.25.28\">2 K 25:28</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 52:32\" href=\"/Jeremiah.52.32\">Je 52:32</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">טוֹבֹתָיו</span> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 6:19\" href=\"/Nehemiah.6.19\">Ne 6:19</a>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>welfare, prosperity, happiness:</em> ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁלום</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 23:7\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.23.7\">Dt 23:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 33:9\" href=\"/Jeremiah.33.9\">Je 33:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 9:12\" href=\"/Ezra.9.12\">Ezr 9:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 3:17\" href=\"/Lamentations.3.17\">La 3:17</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹם טובה</span> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 7:14\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.7.14\">Ec 7:14</a> <em>day of prosperity;</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">טוֹבָתִי בַּל־עָלֶיךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 16:2\" href=\"/Psalms.16.2\">ψ 16:2</a> <em>is not my welfare dependent upon thee?</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּבוֹאָֽתְךָ ט׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 22:21\" href=\"/Job.22.21\">Jb 22:21</a> <em>prosperity shall come to thee;</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">לטובה</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 50:20\" href=\"/Genesis.50.20\">Gn 50:20</a> (E), <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 28:11\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.28.11\">Dt 28:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 30:9\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.30.9\">30:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 18:7\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.18.7\"